Anthropic was forced to cut off access to Claude Fable 5 and Mythos 5, following export restrictions from the Trump administration.

@steph_palazzolo explains her exclusive reporting on Amazon CEO Andy Jassy’s role:

"A lot of this stemmed actually initially from a conversation that Amazon CEO Andy Jassy had with senior Trump officials... where he essentially flagged some jailbreaks and other security related concerns..."

